        <mxCell id="act_appointment" value="&lt;b&gt;lib/actions/appointment.actions.ts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:6px;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;createAppointment()&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;   - Validates doctor availability (CH02 Strategy)&lt;br&gt;   - Mints video consultation room if teleconsult (CH01 Adapter)&lt;br&gt;   - Persists document in Appwrite Databases&lt;br&gt;   - Publishes APPOINTMENT_SCHEDULED domain event (CH03)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;updateAppointment()&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;   - Publishes APPOINTMENT_CANCELLED on cancel (CH03)&lt;br&gt;   - Preserves baseline immediate SMS notification&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;getRecentAppointmentList()&lt;/b&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;b&gt;getAppointment()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
